*/* CSCRWA - CHANNEL SET CHANNEL RECOVERY WORK AREA                  */ 00300064
*/*          THE CST CHANNEL RECOVERY WORK AREA PROVIDES DATA AREAS  */ 00350064
*/*          USED TO CONTROL CHANNEL ERROR RECOVERY FOR A CHANNEL    */ 00400064
*/*          SET.  THERE EXISTS ONE WORK AREA FOR EACH CHANNEL SET.  */ 00450064
*/*          EACH WORK AREA CONTAINS THREE AREAS USED BY CHANNEL     */ 00460064
*/*          RECOVERY TO SCHEDULE AND CONTROL CHANNEL RECOVERY       */ 00470064
*/*          FUNCTIONS.                                              */ 00480064
*/* COPYRIGHT       = NONE                                           */ 00500064
*/* FUNCTION        = MAP THE CHANNEL SET CHANNEL RECOVERY WORK AREA */ 00550064
*/* DEPENDENCIES    = SRB MUST BE DECLARED FIRST             @ZM49377*/ 00600064
*/* MODULE TYPE     = PLS/DSECT                                      */ 00650064
*/* PROCESSOR       = PLS COMPILER OR ASM                            */ 00700064
*/* CHANGE ACTIVITY = NONE                                           */ 00750064
*/*A-000000-999999                                           @G64BPLP*/ 00800064
*/* **************************************************************** */ 00850064
